    "causal_summary": "Plan the Skill Benchmark resume adapter over the sealed typed event ledger. The adapter rebuilds scenario-cell, skill-exposure, trajectory, and scoring state through reducers, maps the continuity ladder, and defines idempotent re-entry without double-apply, lost events, or unsafe replay. It consumes deep-improvement-common services and adds only Skill Benchmark scenario and scoring logic.",
